---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import CoreLayout from '~/layouts/CoreLayout.astro'
import headshot from '~/imgs/clayton-dithered.png'
---

<CoreLayout
	seo={{
		title: 'brag | clayton schneider',
		description:
			"clayton schneider's brag page. An opportunity to unabashedly brag about my accomplishments and capabilities."
	}}
>
	<main class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-10">
		<section class="border-primary grid gap-6 border p-4 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_180px] sm:items-start">
			<div>
				<h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold">
					<a
						class="text-neutral-300 transition-colors hover:text-primary"
						href="/"
						aria-label="Back to homepage"
						>/</a
					>brag
				</h1>
				<div class="mt-6 space-y-4">
					<p>
						This page is inspired by the “slash brag” concept discussed on the Mostly Technical
						podcast: a page on a personal website that exists as an opportunity to brag.
					</p>
					<p>
						I am not always good at talking about myself or my accomplishments. This page is a place
						to practice being honest about my work, effort, follow-through, and success.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<figure class="border border-neutral-700 bg-neutral-950 p-2">
				<Image
					src={headshot}
					alt="Dithered headshot of Clayton Schneider"
					width="180"
					class="w-full"
				/>
			</figure>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-10">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Education</h2>
			<div class="mt-4 space-y-6">
				<article>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Georgia Institute of Technology</h3>
					<p class="text-sm text-neutral-300">Jan 2024 – May 2026</p>
					<p>Master of Science in Computer Science, specializing in Computing Systems.</p>
				</article>

				<article>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold">University of Connecticut</h3>
					<p class="text-sm text-neutral-300">Aug 2016 – May 2020</p>
					<p>
						Bachelor’s degree in Management and Engineering for Manufacturing, a dual degree program
						from the business and engineering schools.
					</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-10">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Projects</h2>
			<div class="mt-4 space-y-6">
				<article>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold">icheatatwordle</h3>
					<p>
						Built and published <a class="text-primary underline" href="https://icheatatwordle.com"
							>icheatatwordle.com</a
						>, a Wordle companion app that makes finding the next guess easier.
					</p>
					<p class="mt-2">
						The project has had 32 unique visitors in the past 32 days. I also rebuilt it with zero
						runtime dependencies and documented the technical tradeoffs in a{' '}
						<a class="text-primary underline" href="/projects/icheatatwordle">project analysis</a>.
					</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-10">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Life Experiences</h2>
			<div class="mt-4 space-y-6">
				<article>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold">30,000-mile road trip</h3>
					<p class="text-sm text-neutral-300">March 2021 – June 2021</p>
					<p>
						Lived in my Chevy Tahoe and drove around the United States, covering roughly 30,000
						miles and visiting 46 national parks.
					</p>
					<p class="mt-2">
						I plan to turn this into a larger section of the site where I document each national
						park.
					</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-10">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">More to document</h2>
			<ul class="mt-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2">
				<li>Georgia Tech classes</li>
				<li>Class projects</li>
				<li>Personal projects</li>
				<li>Smaller wins I usually forget to count</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-10">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Contact</h2>
			<p class="mt-4">If something here makes you think I could help with something, reach out.</p>
		</section>
	</main>
</CoreLayout>
